   "id": null,
   "title": "Exterior Design",
   "intro": "The Swift Trawler 43 Fly features a stronger and more purposeful silhouette, inspired by the passagemaker spirit while expressing a contemporary vision of life on the water. Its sleek profile, high bow and redesigned proportions reinforce its character while delivering a confident presence underway.\nThe flybridge creates a generous outdoor living space featuring a large U-shaped seating area with an adaptive backrest, allowing several guests to enjoy forward-facing views while cruising and transforming into a convivial lounge at anchor.\nThe flybridge also integrates dedicated storage and transport solutions for leisure equipment, making it easy to carry paddleboards, kayaks or a tender. An available Tenderlift solution simplifies launching and handling.\nThe adaptive cockpit delivers greater space and flexibility, with the option to integrate a sliding seat configuration depending on use and onboard lifestyle.\nDesigned to simplify manoeuvring and expand cruising possibilities, the boat incorporates practical features focused on ease of use: a hinging radar mast to reduce air draft, secure side access and optimised circulation throughout the exterior spaces.",
