   "title": "Interior Design",
   "intro": "On board, the Swift Trawler 43 Fly embraces a more residential approach to cruising thanks to generous volumes, premium materials and ergonomics designed for extended stays.\nThe enlarged galley with Corian countertop delivers increased functionality and storage capacity, while the saloon encourages moments of connection in a warm and contemporary atmosphere.\nOptional electric skylights and integrated solar panels further enhance life on board.\nThe accommodation spaces focus on privacy and wellbeing, with an inviting owner’s cabin, a redesigned guest cabin and bathrooms equipped with true separate shower cubicles. The portside cabin benefits from direct access to the day head through a Jack & Jill configuration.\nFor an even more refined onboard experience, the Luxe Pack enhances the atmosphere with upgraded finishes inspired by motoryacht standards.",
